msgid "Desktop Subsystem for Android™ runs Android in its own lightweight virtual machine and shows each app in its own window."
msgstr "Desktop Subsystem for Android™ esegue Android in una propria macchina virtuale leggera e mostra ogni app in una propria finestra."

